    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Merge &amp; Meow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge &amp; Meow is a charming and intriguing merge game where you play as a cat. With your big, fluffy paws, drag and merge sea objects that fall into an aquarium, trying to solve mysteries with the new items you create!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From marbles to ancient anchors, seashells to mysterious treasure chests, combine various objects to gradually explore the calm yet enchanting world inside the aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Play as a Cat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your fluffy paws to drag and merge objects. It's truly &quot;paw-some&quot; time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/5d153553bed351197abee89850e3cb34.poster.avif?t=1747760260\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/5d153553bed351197abee89850e3cb34.webm?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/5d153553bed351197abee89850e3cb34.mp4?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Merge &amp; Level Up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge identical objects to reach rarer items; each new object takes you to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/4fdde21379831dd2c2ee7e93b18d3d83.poster.avif?t=1747760260\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/4fdde21379831dd2c2ee7e93b18d3d83.webm?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/4fdde21379831dd2c2ee7e93b18d3d83.mp4?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Destroy Feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate useless objects to free up space and create more combination opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b06\ufe0f Upgrade Mechanic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade objects individually or all of the same type at once to reach the maximum level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Destroy All Identical Objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear unnecessary clutter and build your strategy more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/b57e52f006e94f8ee5fe9749c1d318ae.poster.avif?t=1747760260\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/b57e52f006e94f8ee5fe9749c1d318ae.webm?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/b57e52f006e94f8ee5fe9749c1d318ae.mp4?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 Score Tracking and Competition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each merge increases your score. Achieve the highest score and surpass your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/e972dda851bbbf23a99e89cd7e6ed50c.poster.avif?t=1747760260\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/e972dda851bbbf23a99e89cd7e6ed50c.webm?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/e972dda851bbbf23a99e89cd7e6ed50c.mp4?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Customization Options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your cat, in-game objects, and backgrounds to make your aquarium uniquely yours.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Merge &amp; Meow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge &amp; Meow is a charming and intriguing merge game where you play as a cat. With your big, fluffy paws, drag and merge sea objects that fall into an aquarium, trying to solve mysteries with the new items you create!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From marbles to ancient anchors, seashells to mysterious treasure chests, combine various objects to gradually explore the calm yet enchanting world inside the aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Play as a Cat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your fluffy paws to drag and merge objects. It's truly &quot;paw-some&quot; time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/5d153553bed351197abee89850e3cb34.poster.avif?t=1747760260\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/5d153553bed351197abee89850e3cb34.webm?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/5d153553bed351197abee89850e3cb34.mp4?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Merge &amp; Level Up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge identical objects to reach rarer items; each new object takes you to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/4fdde21379831dd2c2ee7e93b18d3d83.poster.avif?t=1747760260\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/4fdde21379831dd2c2ee7e93b18d3d83.webm?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/4fdde21379831dd2c2ee7e93b18d3d83.mp4?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Destroy Feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate useless objects to free up space and create more combination opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b06\ufe0f Upgrade Mechanic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade objects individually or all of the same type at once to reach the maximum level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Destroy All Identical Objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear unnecessary clutter and build your strategy more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/b57e52f006e94f8ee5fe9749c1d318ae.poster.avif?t=1747760260\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/b57e52f006e94f8ee5fe9749c1d318ae.webm?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/b57e52f006e94f8ee5fe9749c1d318ae.mp4?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 Score Tracking and Competition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each merge increases your score. Achieve the highest score and surpass your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/e972dda851bbbf23a99e89cd7e6ed50c.poster.avif?t=1747760260\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/e972dda851bbbf23a99e89cd7e6ed50c.webm?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732940/extras/e972dda851bbbf23a99e89cd7e6ed50c.mp4?t=1747760260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Customization Options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your cat, in-game objects, and backgrounds to make your aquarium uniquely yours.</p>",
    "short_description": "Merge &amp; Meow is a relaxing puzzle game where a cute cat merges ocean-themed objects in an aquarium to uncover mysteries. Discover new surprises with every merge, level up, and enjoy a delightful journey accompanied by lo-fi music.",
